TY  - JOUR
TI  - Constructing a synthetic city for estimating spatially disaggregated heat demand
AU  - Muñoz H., M. Esteban
AU  - Dochev, Ivan
AU  - Seller, Hannes
AU  - Peters, Irene
VL  - 9
IS  - 3
PY  - 2016
DA  - 2016/12/31
